===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|computing}} To replace or supplement with a [[wildcard]] character to allow [[match]]ing against a range of possible values.
#* {{quote-text|en|year=2002|author=Eric Van der Vlist|title=XML Schema|page=183
|passage=The unfortunate consequence is that document elements cannot be '''wildcarded''' because a schema needs to provide a closed list of possible document elements.}}

